  "description": "The emotion expressed is hatred, conveyed through the antisemitic stereotype of 'jew jerky' and the use of the crucifixion image to dehumanize Jewish people. The text instructs to 'leave out in the sun until all moisture is gone' and 'store in a cool dark place for 3 days,' which is a grotesque metaphor implying Jewish people are inedible and undesirable, reinforcing antisemitic hatred.",
